---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <div class="maintenance-container">
    <div class="glow-effect-1"></div>
    <div class="glow-effect-2"></div>

    <div class="maintenance-card">
      <div class="icon-wrapper">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="wrench-icon">
          <path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="badge">
        <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
        <span>Pemeliharaan Sistem Aktif</span>
      </div>

      <h1>Generator Kursi Sedang Pemeliharaan</h1>
      <p class="description">
        Sistem <strong>Generator Kursi Praktikum</strong> sedang diperbarui atau dikalibrasi oleh Tim Laboratorium Informatika. Mohon bersabar, kami akan segera beroperasi kembali!
      </p>

      <div class="info-box">
        <div class="info-icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
            <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="info-text">
          <strong>Perhatian untuk Sesi Praktikum:</strong>
          <span>Jika jam praktikum sudah dimulai, silakan ikuti instruksi pengaturan tempat duduk secara manual dari Asisten Praktikum di laboratorium.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer-copy">
        INFORMATICS LAB TELKOM UNIVERSITY &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .maintenance-container {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--bg-page);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .glow-effect-1 {
    position: absolute;
    top: 15%;
    left: 20%;
    width: 350px;
    height: 350px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-light) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(50px);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .glow-effect-2 {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 10%;
    right: 15%;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(60px);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .maintenance-card {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    max-width: 540px;
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    backdrop-filter: blur(var(--glass-blur));
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(var(--glass-blur));
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 48px 40px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .icon-wrapper {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--accent-surface);
    border: 1px solid rgba(138, 180, 248, 0.2);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: inset 0 2px 10px rgba(138, 180, 248, 0.15);
  }

  .wrench-icon {
    animation: bounce-slow 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes bounce-slow {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(8deg); }
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background: var(--warning-surface);
    color: var(--warning);
    border: 1px solid rgba(253, 214, 99, 0.25);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--warning);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--warning);
    animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    50% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(0.85); }
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  .description {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 32px 0;
  }

  .info-box {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--bg-row-even);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .info-icon {
    color: var(--warning);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .info-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .info-text strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .footer-copy {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    opacity: 0.6;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
